  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">간단한 2인용 소화게임입니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">좀 고쳐야 할 부분이 많은데, 일단 한번 올려 ^^;;; 봅니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e657fa618627a3512cf896ad0b4e9f4aad31fd70\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e657fa618627a3512cf896ad0b4e9f4aad31fd70\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">우선 16장의 카드를 무작위로 섞어 4x4 말판에 놓고, 탄단지 말은 [시작]에 놓습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4dc2909b918f08cd3f247699ee748d563bd5a95\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4dc2909b918f08cd3f247699ee748d563bd5a95\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이제 카드를 오픈합니다. 서로 마주보고 하는 게임이라 카드의 방향 운빨!<br><br>같은 줄에 [기관] 에 맞는 [영양소]와 [소화효소]가 있으면 다음 기관으로 이동하는 게임입니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7791014328b0225d2bfcdffd17d44bf67077ad18\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7791014328b0225d2bfcdffd17d44bf67077ad18\" data-origin-width=\"580\" data-origin-height=\"435\"><div class=\"figcaption\">규칙은</div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">1. 입 → 위 → 소장 → 대장 end 까지 먼저 도착하면 승리!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">2. 각 기관에서 같은 줄에 [영양소], [소화효소] 카드가 있으면 다음 기관으로 GO!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">3. 본인 턴에 1번씩 카드 위치 교체 가능!</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래는 설명하는 영상입니다. (설명 영상 재촬영하였습니다. 5분)</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvqo0vhe0vaerj4kth2fnnppx@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/thumb/S712x400/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Fthumb.kakaocdn.net%2Fdna%2Fkamp%2Fsource%2Frvqo0vhe0vaerj4kth2fnnppx%2Fthumbs%2F2.jpg%3Fcredential%3DTuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK%26expires%3D33162403214%26signature%3DD8cAgDhOOj6YcBzqcIN13HFJWTc%253D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rvqo0vhe0vaerj4kth2fnnppx?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2cW8wdmhlMHZhZXJqNGt0aDJmbm5wcHgiLCJ0aWQiOiIxMDE3NzFkMS04YTMzLTQxYTAtYWVkOS05Y2UwMGQyMTBlOTAiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQ4NzN9.rT3AtJtW_iuIFnCTcWg3AklWgsjeEsZGot7dLik_g0kMew9ONfP0nyQBWKJlRrbD-Rddv_0w5LRStO3RN_KCoA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">게임이 뭔가 마음에 차지 않는데...어케 보강이 좀 가능할까요... <br>선생님들의 피드백 부탁드립니다.<br><br>날이 많이 차네요. 따뜻한 11월 되세요. *(^-^)*</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/902dfc601d76e456cf2ff1ef294917f856bdffb9\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/902dfc601d76e456cf2ff1ef294917f856bdffb9\" data-origin-width=\"400\" data-origin-height=\"400\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b13c1233ae14356d8f961afbc0d3686ee12b5220?download\" data-file-name=\"소화게임_양면짧은면인쇄.hwp\" data-file-size=\"927744\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D436%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20201109193755&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb13c1233ae14356d8f961afbc0d3686ee12b5220')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">소화게임_양면짧은면인쇄</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">906.00KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/602f8766251057e6f34b2ffcb4fc838c16ea6041?download\" data-file-name=\"소화말판_B4.hwp\" data-file-size=\"70144\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D436%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20201109193755&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F602f8766251057e6f34b2ffcb4fc838c16ea6041')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">소화말판_B4</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">68.50KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
